# SHA-256 of the nginx source tarballs this project builds against.
#
# TLS protects the download in transit but not against a compromised origin, a
# CDN edge, or a tampered upstream artifact -- so the expected hash is pinned
# here, in the repository, and every fetch is checked against it. A pin
# committed to our own tree is a stronger anchor than a signature checked with
# a key fetched from the same host that served the tarball.
#
# To add or move a version: download it, verify it out of band against the
# detached signature at <url>.asc using a key whose fingerprint you have
# cross-checked at https://nginx.org/en/pgp_keys.html, then record it here.
